      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Honestly, well said. I personally agree that the heavy push for micro transactions is scary. I don't think it sets a good look. Especially at a $10 price tag. It's not cheap and I couldn't think of putting that much on the table for decor. I already didn't like it in the beta and loathe it at $10. It's actually really sad. I can't get behind it. Won't be spending any money on any of it. \n\nThe fact that what feels like the entire VRC team is telling us to suck it up and get over it is even more frustrating. I think the inly person who gave us reliable feedback in response to us was Strasz. Everyone else just told us that they weren't changing anything and when we asked for things to return like the interactions icon, they just gave us a distinct \"no\" without directly saying \"no.\" They haven't been too positive about feedback we've provided and the distaste for the profile decor. I just want to be able to disable it. Especially now that I know I cannot spend the money on it anyways.",
